1
00:00:02,950 --> 00:00:05,898
The prettiest little beach road in Florida!

2
00:00:05,898 --> 00:00:08,435
A town where every building is white.

3
00:00:08,435 --> 00:00:10,835
The real town from The Truman Show.

4
00:00:10,835 --> 00:00:13,440
And rare lakes right behind the beach!

5
00:00:14,390 --> 00:00:21,459
This is Scenic Highway 30A, on the Florida Panhandle: sugar-white sand and little beach towns.

6
00:00:21,459 --> 00:00:25,370
Stick around till the end for the full trip planner!

7
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:27,521
Here's the plan!

8
00:00:27,521 --> 00:00:35,180
We start in Rosemary Beach, then Alys Beach, Seaside and Grayton Beach, and we finish at Eden Gardens!

9
00:00:36,130 --> 00:00:39,873
We're starting in Rosemary Beach, on Scenic Highway 30A!

10
00:00:39,873 --> 00:00:45,020
Cobblestone streets, boardwalks down to the beach, and that sugar-white sand.

11
00:00:45,970 --> 00:00:47,730
Just a mile down the road!

12
00:00:49,570 --> 00:00:50,476
Look at this!

13
00:00:50,476 --> 00:00:54,379
Alys Beach, where almost every building is bright white.

14
00:00:54,379 --> 00:00:58,630
It looks like a little Mediterranean town, right on the Gulf.

15
00:00:59,580 --> 00:01:05,570
West on 30A, past the coastal dune lakes, to a town you might recognize!

16
00:01:06,520 --> 00:01:07,801
Welcome to Seaside!

17
00:01:07,801 --> 00:01:08,745
Look familiar?

18
00:01:08,745 --> 00:01:12,049
This pastel town was the set for The Truman Show!

19
00:01:12,049 --> 00:01:15,420
Grab a bite from the Airstream food trucks on 30A.

20
00:01:16,370 --> 00:01:19,090
Just down the road to Grayton Beach State Park!

21
00:01:20,040 --> 00:01:22,368
This is Grayton Beach State Park!

22
00:01:22,368 --> 00:01:26,600
Right behind the dunes is Western Lake, a coastal dune lake.

23
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:30,550
Lakes like this are only found in a few places on Earth!

24
00:01:31,500 --> 00:01:37,900
North on County Road 395, away from the beach and under the live oaks!

25
00:01:38,850 --> 00:01:48,610
We finish at Eden Gardens State Park, with a white-columned mansion from 1897 and giant live oaks dripping with Spanish moss!

26
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:51,061
And that's the drive!

27
00:01:51,061 --> 00:01:56,420
A short road, packed with beach towns, from Rosemary Beach to Eden Gardens.

28
00:01:57,370 --> 00:02:00,530
Here's your trip planner, everything in one place.

29
00:02:00,530 --> 00:02:02,300
Pause and grab a screenshot!

30
00:02:05,870 --> 00:02:07,442
Thanks for riding along!

31
00:02:07,442 --> 00:02:15,500
Subscribe to Road Trip Atlas for more road trips, and next time we're heading west to Utah, starting at Zion National Park!
